# macOS/iCloud sync duplicates ("test_map_api 2.py", "routes.d 2.ts"). These
# are byte-identical copies, and a duplicated test file makes pytest collect
# and run the same tests twice -- which has already caused false failures by
# tripping per-endpoint rate limits.
